; What Message does: one operation for every effect

Operation
[ address:[ Process Metaflow Sender ] lock:Lock request:Request ] ; imports
[ Identify.Process                             ; operations: ask Flow who called
  Lock.Metaflow                                ;   ask Flow for a lock
  Deliver.{ Lock                               ;   hand Flow the request under the lock
            Sender
            Request }
  Enqueue.{ Sender                             ;   keep a request for a metaflow
            Metaflow
            Request } ]
[ Identified.Sender                            ; outcomes
  Locked.Lock
  Delivered
  Enqueued
  Failed.[ Unidentified
           OutOfLevel
           Unknown
           Held
           Undelivered
           StoreRefused ] ]
[]                                             ; types
